# every modifier, and Shift on a key that types a symbol
super + Return
    konsole
ctrl + alt + Left
    komorebic stack left
alt + shift + h
    komorebic move left
ctrl + shift + Right
    komorebic resize-edge right increase
alt + shift + 1
    komorebic move-to-workspace 0
ctrl + alt + shift + 9
    komorebic move-to-workspace 8
super + ctrl + alt + shift + a
    komorebic retile
ctrl + alt + shift + m
    komorebic toggle-monocle
